<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Capital six-mth net up 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Capital six-mth net up 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		67.65	  vs	  42.28</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     12.00	  vs	   7.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		 357.83	  vs	 244.24</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 113.58	  vs	  66.40</p>
<p>    Minorities (less)     13.96	  vs (less)  8.05</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  7.88	  vs	    nil</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)    8.00	  vs	   3.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Berjaya Capital Bhd is engaged in life assurance and general insurance as well as hire purchase and leasing.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
